Content-Type: text/plain; charset="us-ascii"

Good morning all, Axon would like to come out to San Mateo to do an in-person executive presentation on the Axon technology and ALPR's. They are looking at some dates next week or the following week. Attached is a sample of how we can structure the day with up to two council members at a time. This would be a great opportunity for our city leaders to ask any questions they might have, and they will be hearing directly from Axon. If I could have some help with times and dates that work best with council I will work to confirm with Axon. Please let me know if you have any questions or need any further information. Thank you for your support.

Anthony



[cid:image001.png@01DD2FAF.600E8710]  Anthony Riccardi
   Lieutenant / Field Operations / S.W.A.T.
   San Mateo Police Department
   200 Franklin Parkway, San Mateo CA 94403
